WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a wide stance, turn the front foot out and extend the arms wide.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Reach forward over the front leg, then lower the front hand to shin, block, or floor.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Extend the top arm to the sky, stacking the shoulders.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lengthen evenly through both sides of the waist. Switch sides.
